error[E0521]: borrowed data escapes outside of closure
  --> tests/ui/diagnostic_change_escape.rs:19:13
   |
15 |     let escaped: Arc<Mutex<Vec<Change<'static, (), usize>>>> = Arc::new(Mutex::new(Vec::new()));
   |         ------- `escaped` declared here, outside of the closure body
...
18 |         move |change| {
   |               ------ `change` is a reference that is only valid in the closure body
19 |             escaped.lock().unwrap().push(change);
   |             ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^ `change` escapes the closure body here
