   = note: requirement occurs because of the type `std::sync::Mutex<Vec<Change<'_, (), usize>>>`, which makes the generic argument `Vec<Change<'_, (), usize>>` invariant
   = note: the struct `std::sync::Mutex<T>` is invariant over the parameter `T`
